OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist toilet user locked out
OL,4,Aafter security fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new security system installed at a
OL,7,Fspecialist toilet, designed for people
OL,8,Fwith severe disabilities and their
OL,9,Fcarers, has been criticised after a
OL,10,Ffault left users unable to access the
OL,11,Ffacility.
OL,13,FThe Changing Places toilet in
OL,14,FBournemouth's Lower Gardens reopened in
OL,15,FAugust after being closed for a year
OL,16,Fdue to vandalism and antisocial
OL,17,Fbehaviour.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
