OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist toilet user locked out
OL,4,Aafter security fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FBournemouth Christchurch and Poole
OL,7,F(BCP) Council has introduced a
OL,8,Fvideo-enabled intercom, requiring users
OL,9,Fto call for access during opening
OL,10,Fhours, but Gemma Cardona said calls by
OL,11,Fher son's carers went unanswered more
OL,12,Fthan once.
OL,14,FThe authority said a "software error"
OL,15,Fhad been identified, adding the system
OL,16,Fhad been updated and was now working as
OL,17,Fintended.
